  "honestFindings": [
    "The exact protocol-1 v2 archive decoder already accepts dependsOn and rejects admission and raisedBy. Version 3 accepts all checked historical and current Task shapes.",
    "The public 0.1.14 ZIP and exact static app.asar slices pin schema 18, Station baseline 5 with support 5/5/5, Work v2, and the v2 Task authoring shape.",
    "The release-line archive qualification driver records zero guarded decoder invocations when offered protocol 1. That proves only the reviewable archive driver, not production package ingress ordering.",
    "The focused qualifier never imports or spawns released app.asar bytes. Static markers and an unsigned run observation do not prove preface rejection before Work decode.",
    "No released older Remote artifact exists. The current protocol-1 v2 and v3 cohorts are unreleased source archives, and no Station protocol bytes are changed by this proof."
  ],
